    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Advice and conditions",
     "texto": [
      "**gerekmek** = to be necessary; **zorunda olmak** = to have to.",
      "**daha çok** = more; **daha az** = less.",
      "The condition with **-sa/-se** links a situation and its result: **erken yatarsan dinlenirsin** = if you go to bed early, you rest."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
